. clear all

. set seed 1995

. 
. set obs 1000
Number of observations (_N) was 0, now 1,000.

. gen bv0 = 20 + 5*rnormal()

. gen e   = 0.10*bv0 + 1.5*rnormal()

. gen div = 0.4*e + 0.5*rnormal()

. gen bv1 = bv0 + e - div

. gen mv  = 2 + 5.0*e + 0.8*bv1 + 3*rnormal()

. 
